00:58:29.950 --> 00:58:32.110
- Yeah.

00:58:32.110 --> 00:58:35.120
Hang out in my email for a
day and you'll see that higher ed--

00:58:35.120 --> 00:58:38.620
it's a massive industry.
There are thousands of universities.

00:58:38.620 --> 00:58:43.510
And yes, there are institutions
that have fully gone into

00:58:43.510 --> 00:58:48.790
a variety of cloud environments
for a variety of reasons. So

00:58:48.790 --> 00:58:50.790
no doubt.

